{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37482","headline":"寄处士方干 · 周朴","name":"寄处士方干","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桐庐江水闲，终日对柴关。\n因想别离处，不知多少山。\n钓舟春岸泊，庭树晓莺还。\n莫便求栖隐，桂枝堪恨颜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周朴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37482.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37482","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}